== About me

I am currently a postdoctoral fellow at the Hong Kong University of Science and Technology, working with [https://cse.hkust.edu.hk/~charlesz/ Prof. Charles Zhang]. I received my Ph.D. from Sun Yat-sen University, where I was fortunate to be advised by [https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zWnsNrkAAAAJ&hl=en Prof. Zibin Zheng] and [https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=tkE-vsEAAAAJ&hl=en Prof. Yuhong Nan]. I used to work on software security, building automated testing and analysis tools to find bugs in blockchain systems and compilers. I am currently interested in LLMs for security and software analysis, and LLM security. I used to play CTFs and hunt bugs on Immunefi.

== Education

- *Sun Yat-sen University*
Ph.D. in Software Engineering (Advisor: Prof. Zibin Zheng & Prof. Yuhong Nan), from Sept. 2021 to Jul. 2026.

- *Sun Yat-sen University*
B.Sc. in Mathematics and Applied Mathematics (w/ Outstanding Graduate Award), from Sept. 2017 to Jun. 2021.

== Experiences

- Research intern in Ant Group. Working on smart contract fuzzing and bug hunting.
- Research intern in an AI agent startup (HKUST spin-off). Working on cost-efficient coding agents.

